        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"task\": \"Go to trendyol.com. Find and click the login button (usually top right). Enter email 'caagdas@hotmail.com' and password 'Cagdasdeneme123!' and login. After successful login, find the search bar and search for 'laptop'. Wait for results to load. From the search results page, extract the FIRST 5 products. For each product get: product name, price (in TL), and rating score. Return as JSON array with fields: name, price, rating.\",\n  \"model\": \"bu-mini\"\n}\n",
